#################################################################
#  v1.4.0 — the releases this development actually shipped.
#
#  Backfilled from git and the shipped changelog, not from
#  recollection: every date is a commit timestamp, every title a
#  changelog headline, every evidence record a real commit SHA.
#  L-112 governs the shape of these entries — they RECORD a past
#  state and are written once, never repointed.
#
#  hasDuration carries ELAPSED days between consecutive releases.
#  hasActualEffort is deliberately ABSENT: elapsed time is not
#  effort, no effort was measured at the time, and inventing one
#  would be the fabrication this framework exists to refuse.
#################################################################

