    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Counted from backlog_tbox_v1_17_0.ttl: CostDimension, hasDimensionUnit, hasDimensionRate, hasRateCurrency, DimensionalCost, costOfItem, alongDimension, hasQuantity, isEstimatedCost, Budget, budgetFor, budgetDimension, hasBudgetCeiling. Estimate was 12; actual 13. The extra is hasRateCurrency, which the estimate folded into the rate and which a moment's thought about summing two currencies shows must be separate." .

