    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "The scope-first fixture links each objective to its scope with fillsScope and validates at L4 with 0 of 49 constraints suppressed. This register, built scope-last, validates at 0 violations and raises the legacy-order advisory — so both orders are expressible and each records which one it used. Re-pointing an existing link in place is rejected by MixedOrderShape at L1." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "backlog_validate + pyshacl" ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion fw:AC_OrderRecord .

fw:Obs_OrderRecordable a backlog:MetricObservation ;
