    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Re-ran the three as-is probes. Grooming: a story reaching Ready must now be analysed against every concern it declares, and a story declaring none must say so with a reason. Package sizing: an iteration committing beyond capacity is rejected, and a deployment carrying unplanned work is rejected at L4. Autonomy-graded evidence remains unbuilt — refused by Ex_InventedPractice for want of a named source relating execution autonomy to required evidence. Baseline 3, observed 1, and the remaining 1 is a boundary decision rather than undone work." .

