#################################################################
#  v3.2.0 — the four drift mechanisms applied to this register.
#
#  RC1: every intent element now states its origin. All 21 are
#  IOrigin_SessionDrafted, because that is what they are: this
#  session wrote every scope, goal and objective in this register.
#  Only Mission_BuildSoftware is owner-stated. Recording it does
#  not make it better — it makes it VISIBLE, which is the whole
#  mechanism.
#
#  RC2: every goal now names the scope it derives from.
#  RC3: every objective names the work that can move its metric.
#  RC4: the deployment gap is measured, not papered over.
#################################################################
fw:Scope backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_SessionDrafted .
