    backlog:hasSelectionBasis backlog:Sel_Committed ;
    backlog:hasRationale "Consolidates work completed across the whole development and never recorded as delivered. Committed rather than highest-scored because the package carries everything already done, not a value-selected subset — the register must say how contents were chosen, and this was not a prioritisation decision." ;
