    backlog:hasScoreRationale "Highest value in the register: it is the deliverable the other two rest on. A specification is a model artefact and so is a test case's subject, so nothing downstream can be typed until the artefact concept exists. Job size small because UML 2.5 supplies the taxonomy whole — 14 diagrams in two kinds, structure and behaviour — and nothing has to be invented." ;
