    backlog:hasObservedValue 0.0 ;
    backlog:observedAt "2026-08-26T20:45:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Counted by direct class lookup against the shipped TBox, the same method as the baseline. ModelArtifact, ModelKind, Specification, InteractionStep, StateChange, TestCase, TestData all present; UseCase is expressible as a ModelArtifact of Kind_UseCaseDiagram and needs no class of its own. Baseline 8, observed 0." .

