#
#  Extending GroomingShape from Story to Epic and Initiative
#  immediately found 26 containers that had reached Done or
#  InProgress with NO analysis recorded. The level where a boundary
#  decision is most consequential was the level nothing checked.
#
#  Each is now groomed at the level it belongs to. An epic's
#  analysis is not its stories' analysis summed: an epic decides
#  what the theme requires, a story decides how a slice is built.
