    backlog:observedAt "2026-08-27T06:35:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Counted over registered CodeTable individuals rather than by regex: 26 tables in the tooling, 14 holding classification knowledge, of which LAYERS and the quality metrics have moved. The baseline of 23 counted every capitalised assignment, including 12 operational tables that state how the tooling runs rather than what anything IS. Exporting those would add classes the exported material does not require, which is what Obj_NoNewClasses is held at zero to prevent — the migration would breach the containment goal while satisfying the scope goal. Observed 13 as the honest remaining population." .

#  It10 batch 1: CONTAINER_TYPES and SECTIONS are register-level
#  individuals. STAGE_TYPES states what the STAGES require and the
#  stages are TBox individuals, so it belongs in the TBox — found
#  when the reader parsed only the TBox and reported FATAL. The
#  loud failure located the misplacement immediately, which is what
#  it exists for.
