    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-08-27T07:45:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "KINDS forced the sharpest split of the migration: it paired an evidence CLASS with a python function checking it. Exporting the pair would have put a lambda's identity in an ontology; exporting neither would leave the coverage question unanswerable. Which kinds are covered moved; how each is checked stayed. FOREIGN is a governance statement — which namespaces an adopter may not assume are theirs — and was a dictionary in a readiness script. SUITES keeps its filename glob beside the name, because separating them would leave the ontology naming suites nothing could find." ;
